00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.440
That was amazing!

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:43.640
Nice transition for me putting on the suit!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.860
I'm sure it didn't seem like I got naked or anything.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.620
Aww, that's so cool.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.640
See, I'm a little concerned

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.900
