00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.500
I have a funny feeling that we the best of friends

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.500
Holy shit, what is that?

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.700
Aww man, sorry, didn't mean to punch you bro.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.500
Wow.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.300
Ho-ho-ho-holy shit.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.400
Oh man,

